  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Clerics of the Discovery Domain in Lyonesse worship the gods of the Grimfolk, carried across the sea when the first raiders came to these shores centuries ago. The Discovery Domain is devoted to exploration and the claiming of hidden riches. These Clerics serve as guides within Grimfolk raiding clans, leading their people into the unknown. For their insight and ambition, they are honored and respected, yet often feared, for they are the first to step where others dare not and the ones who decide what is worth taking.</p>"
    },
